# Cloudflare (always on for this repo)

This project deploys to Cloudflare Workers. Prefer Cloudflare MCP + Wrangler over guesswork.

## Permanent account context

- Account ID: `2373013c66331e9660e47ffa3ae40f5c` (Info@luminara.digital's Account)
- Zone ID: `495e6808c92887d826486bde8550f194` (luminarasuite.com)
- Worker name: `luminara-search-oracle-agent`
- Domains: `luminarasuite.com`, `www.luminarasuite.com`
- Config: `wrangler.jsonc` already has `account_id`

## MCP usage

- Keep the Cursor Cloudflare plugin enabled (`.cursor/settings.json` → `plugins.cloudflare.enabled`).
- When calling account-scoped Cloudflare MCP tools, always pass `account_id` `2373013c66331e9660e47ffa3ae40f5c` unless the tool already defaults to it.
- Prefer MCP servers: docs, bindings, builds, observability.
- Never put API tokens, R2 keys, or Worker secrets in committed files.

## Deploy path

- Production deploy: `npm run deploy` or push to `main` (GitHub Actions uses `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` / `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` secrets).
- Local secrets live under `.secrets/` and `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
